<https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/69508e13bbcc669881bd5c1cf0a99d4781a86d4d#_parse_time> <https://repolex.ai/ontology/extracts/tree-sitter/tree-sitter/v0.25/core/text> "def _parse_time(expression, clock=_clock):\n    best = float('inf')\n    p = Parser()\n    duration = 0\n    i = 0\n    while True:\n        i += 1\n        p.purge()\n        start = clock()\n        p.parse(expression)\n        end = clock()\n        total = end - start\n        duration += total\n        if duration >= APPROX_RUN_TIME:\n            break\n    return duration / i" <https://repolex.ai/data/jmespath/jmespath.py/blob/69508e13bbcc669881bd5c1cf0a99d4781a86d4d> .
